          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ In those days, and at that time, will I cause the Branch of righteousness to grow up unto David; and he shall execute judgment and righteousness in the land.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In those days shall Judah be saved, and Jerusalem shall dwell safely: and this",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is the name",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.33.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.33.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wherewith she shall be called, The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.33.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.33.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "our righteousness.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
